# Integer subtraction near the 64-bit limit

Subtracts 5 from a value just below the signed 64-bit maximum to protect
arithmetic near the supported upper bound.

>>> source
const pos_right: int = 5
const big: int = 9223372036854775800

const big_diff: int = big - pos_right
print(big_diff)

<<< stdout
9223372036854775795

<<< stderr
